WEBVTT

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.720
It was hot,

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.816
one of those Southern days

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.560
where you could
literally feel the pavement --

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:47.000
the vapor seeping out of the pavement.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:52.200
And the group of about 14 of us

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.440
selected Jonathan Daniels,

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:01.536
Father Morrisroe, who had recently
come to the county,